[statement]
A name packages only provide gives way to a requested name as a name some
package carries does (`a-later-name-gives-way-to-a-requested-name-its-best-candidate-forbids`):
`e2`, the best candidate for `E`, which `top` needs, forbids `w`, which
`b` 2, requested, provides. apk takes `e1` for `E`.

[repository]
P:b
V:2
p:w=2

P:top
V:1
D:E

P:e2
V:1
p:E=2
D:!w

P:e1
V:1
p:E=1

[request]
b
top

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install b 2
install e1 1
install top 1
